<!--
    Polish. Translated from **English only** — never from another translation, which compounds every
    interpretation the first translator made.

    Note the four plural categories: Polish uses `one`, `few`, `many` and `other` where English uses
    two. Which categories a language needs is CLDR's decision, and `TranslationTest` enforces it —
    supplying only `one` and `other` here would be a red build, not a silently wrong app.
-->
